Input: {"question": "Which award did Hideo Kojima receive?", "source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 146, "text": "As the sun set over the Stockholm skyline, Hideo Kojima stepped out of the sleek, black town car and onto the cobblestone streets of the Old Town."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 147, "end": 279, "text": "The air was crisp, carrying the whispers of centuries past, and the legendary game designer felt an inexplicable sense of belonging."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 280, "end": 371, "text": "He had been summoned to this enigmatic city for a purpose, one that only a select few knew."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 372, "end": 492, "text": "Kojima's eyes scanned the façade of the Grand Hôtel, its elegant architecture a testament to the country's rich history."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 493, "end": 650, "text": "He was greeted by a dignified figure, resplendent in a tailcoat, who introduced himself as Count Carl Gustaf von Rosen, Chancellor of the Order of the Sword."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 651, "end": 655, "text": "\"Mr."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 656, "end": 748, "text": "Kojima, it is an honor to finally meet you,\" the Count said, his voice like polished silver."}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 749, "end": 816, "text": "\"Your contributions to the world of gaming have not gone unnoticed."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 817, "end": 947, "text": "You have been chosen to receive a prestigious award, one that recognizes your unwavering dedication to the pursuit of excellence.\""}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 948, "end": 1100, "text": "As they entered the hotel's opulent ballroom, Kojima's gaze wandered across the assembly of dignitaries, their faces a blur of curiosity and admiration."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1101, "end": 1210, "text": "He spotted a few familiar faces, fellow visionaries who had pushed the boundaries of their respective crafts."}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1211, "end": 1330, "text": "The atmosphere was alive with anticipation, the soft hum of conversation punctuated by the clinking of crystal glasses."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1331, "end": 1422, "text": "Count von Rosen led Kojima to a velvet-draped podium, where a solitary, ornate box awaited."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1423, "end": 1535, "text": "The Chancellor's hands moved with deliberate precision as he opened the box, revealing a gleaming, golden sword."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1536, "end": 1624, "text": "The room fell silent, the only sound the soft rustle of the sword's silk-lined scabbard."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1625, "end": 1881, "text": "\"Hideo Kojima, in recognition of your innovative spirit and your unwavering commitment to the art of storytelling, we hereby confer upon you the title of Knight of the Order of the Sword,\" the Count declared, his voice resonating through the hallowed hall."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1882, "end": 2031, "text": "As Kojima accepted the sword, its weight settling comfortably in his hand, he felt an unspoken connection to the centuries-old tradition of chivalry."}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2032, "end": 2209, "text": "It was a symbol of his own unyielding pursuit of excellence, a reminder that the boundaries of reality were meant to be pushed, and that the art of storytelling knew no borders."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 12, "text": "Hideo Kojima"}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 14, "end": 94, "text": "Hideo Kojima is a renowned Japanese video game designer, director, and producer."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 95, "end": 246, "text": "He is best known for his work on the Metal Gear series and is widely regarded as one of the most influential and innovative game designers of all time."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 247, "end": 268, "text": "Early Life and Career"}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 270, "end": 338, "text": "Hideo Kojima was born on August 24, 1963, in Setagaya, Tokyo, Japan."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 339, "end": 478, "text": "He developed an interest in writing and storytelling at an early age and began writing short stories and novels while still in high school."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 479, "end": 576, "text": "After graduating from university, Kojima joined Konami, a Japanese video game developer, in 1986."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 577, "end": 595, "text": "Rise to Prominence"}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 597, "end": 703, "text": "Kojima's breakthrough game, Metal Gear, was released in 1987 and became a critical and commercial success."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 704, "end": 834, "text": "The game's unique blend of stealth gameplay and intricate storytelling set it apart from other action-adventure games of the time."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 835, "end": 971, "text": "The success of Metal Gear led to the creation of several sequels and spin-offs, cementing Kojima's reputation as a master game designer."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 972, "end": 992, "text": "Awards and Accolades"}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 994, "end": 1116, "text": "Throughout his career, Kojima has received numerous awards and accolades for his contributions to the video game industry."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1117, "end": 1196, "text": "One of his most notable achievements is receiving the Academy Fellowship Award."}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1197, "end": 1221, "text": "Academy Fellowship Award"}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1223, "end": 1429, "text": "The Academy Fellowship Award is a prestigious honor bestowed by the British Academy of Film and Television Arts (BAFTA) to individuals who have made a significant contribution to the art and craft of games."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1430, "end": 1507, "text": "The award is considered one of the highest honors in the video game industry."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1508, "end": 1602, "text": "In 2020, Hideo Kojima was awarded the Academy Fellowship Award at the 2020 BAFTA Games Awards."}, "D2S19": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1603, "end": 1791, "text": "This recognition was a testament to Kojima's innovative approach to game design, his influence on the industry, and his dedication to pushing the boundaries of storytelling in video games."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1792, "end": 1803, "text": "References:"}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1805, "end": 1886, "text": "* \"Hideo Kojima to receive BAFTA Fellowship\" by GamesIndustry.biz (February 2020)"}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1887, "end": 1955, "text": "* \"Hideo Kojima Receives BAFTA Fellowship Award\" by IGN (March 2020)"}, "D2S23": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1956, "end": 2042, "text": "* \"BAFTA Games Awards 2020: Hideo Kojima receives Fellowship\" by BBC News (March 2020)"}, "D2S24": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2044, "end": 2322, "text": "This Wikipedia entry provides comprehensive evidence for the statement \"Hideo Kojima received the award Academy Fellowship Award\" by presenting a brief overview of Kojima's life and career, followed by a detailed description of the Academy Fellowship Award and its significance."}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "Order of the Sword", "card_ids": ["d1:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Hideo Kojima", "scope": "award", "claim": "Hideo Kojima received the Order of the Sword.", "answer": "Order of the Sword", "quote": "You have been chosen to receive a prestigious award, one that recognizes your unwavering dedication to the pursuit of excellence.\" As they entered the hotel's opulent ballroom, Kojima's gaze wandered across the assembly of dignitaries, their faces a blur of curiosity and admiration. He spotted a few familiar faces, fellow visionaries who had pushed the boundaries of their respective crafts. The atmosphere was alive with anticipation, the soft hum of conversation punctuated by the clinking of crystal glasses. Count von Rosen led Kojima to a velvet-draped podium, where a solitary, ornate box awaited. The Chancellor's hands moved with deliberate precision as he opened the box, revealing a gleaming, golden sword. The room fell silent, the only sound the soft rustle of the sword's silk-lined scabbard. \"Hideo Kojima, in recognition of your innovative spirit and your unwavering commitment to the art of storytelling, we hereby confer upon you the title of Knight of the Order of the Sword,\" the Count declared, his voice resonating through the hallowed hall.", "original_document_number": 1}], "initial_answers": ["Order of the Sword", "Academy Fellowship Award"]}
